  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb with a spelling change: *c→qu* before *e*, to preserve the hard /k/ sound — affects the yo form of Pretérito Indefinido (*arranqué*, not *arrancé*) and all of Subjuntivo Presente (*arranque, arranques...*)",
    "Same pattern as *buscar*, *tocar*, *secar*, *comunicar*",
    "Past participle: *arrancado* (regular)",
    "Three common senses: \"to start\" (an engine/motor) — *el coche no arranca* (the car won't start); \"to pull out/uproot\" — *arrancar las malas hierbas* (to pull out the weeds); \"to tear off/snatch\" — *le arrancó la hoja del cuaderno* (he tore the page out of the notebook)",
    "Related: *arranque* (start/ignition, also a sudden burst of emotion — *un arranque de ira*), *arrancamotores* (starter motor)"
  ],
  "sourceFile": "Verbs/a/Arrancar.md"
